#items(((runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Doom-saga:"), (emph: "", text: " At the beginning of the battle, after deployment, nominate one enemy character on the battlefield. Against this particular target, Gilead re-rolls all failed rolls To Hit and To Wound.")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Melancholic Distractions"), (emph: "", text: ": At the start of each of his turns, Gilead must take a Leadership test, unless he is engaged in combat. If this test is failed, roll a D6. On a 1-3 Gilead cannot move that turn. On a 4-6 Gilead must move his full movement for that turn towards the closest table edge. If he leaves the table, he is treated as a casualty and will not return. If Gilead is engaged in combat, he will fight as normal.")), sub: ()), (runs: ((emph: "bold", text: "Shadowfast"), (emph: "", text: ": Once per game, at the start of any of the High Elf player's movement phase, Gilead may enter Shadowfast. Until the start of his next turn, Gilead's stat line will change to his Shadowfast characteristics. In addition, while Shadowfast, Gilead also gains the Always Strikes First and Dodge (4+) special rules.")), sub: ())))

